  "description": "What? I'm the heir to the throne?!\n\nHorus lives the life of a vagabond until one day, the god of wisdom Thoth appears to him and reveals the truth: Horus is the son of Osiris, the rightful ruler of Egypt who was murdered by his own brother. Now begins his quest to avenge his father and reclaim his birthright as king of Egypt!\n\n(Source: Manta)",
